# What core/cliecho echoes for every route, for every kind of input (#1253).
#
# A line that stops saying "command" is the terminal losing something a
# click can do. "no command" is a whole UI action with no CLI twin.
#
# Re-pin with: UPDATE_CLI_OUTCOMES=1 go test ./cliecho -run TestEveryRouteOutcomeIsInTheGolden (from core/)

